&lt;p&gt;Cold outreach in 2026 is broken. Business owners get flooded every day with generic template spam like &lt;em&gt;"Hey, I noticed your website could use an upgrade..."&lt;/em&gt;—with zero proof and zero personalization.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I spent the last month building an open-source alternative: &lt;strong&gt;Leddro&lt;/strong&gt; 🚀&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Instead of spamming businesses, Leddro discovers authentic local businesses, runs deep server-side diagnostics (DNS, TLS/SSL, TTFB speed, mobile responsiveness), and drafts fact-checked proposals that cite authentic audit findings.&lt;/p&gt;

